2 CONT
2 CONT Torgils Johannesen Galtung-Torsnes  
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 1510 in Aga.Ullensvang.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Torsnes.Jondal.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Johannes Galten Torgilsson Galte-Aga b. 1470 in Aga.Ullensvang.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Gyrid Torgilsdatter Galtung-Aga b. Before 1497 in Aga.Ullensvang.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Changed: 26 Aug 2002 01:00:00 
2 CONT
2 CONT    Spouses & Children    
2 CONT
2 CONT   Birgitte Sjovatsdatter Skiftun (Wife) b. 1540 in Sandanger.Hjelmeland.Norway  
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: ABT 1563 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:   
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Torgilsdatter Galtung-Torsnes b. in Torsnes.Jondal.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Torgilsson Galtung-Fykse b. About 1560 in Fiksdal, Øystese, Hardanger, Hordaland, Norway. 
