2 CONT
2 CONT 6.1. Peder Andersen Riber, f. 1676, d. 1721 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.1. Elisabeth Maria Andersdatter Riber 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.1. Mtta Andersdatter Riber 
2 CONT
2 CONT As translated from the "Gards- og ttesoge for Eidfjord" After her husband, the priest, Anders Anderson Riber's death, Katrina lived for the rest of her life at their farm, Lgreid Nedre, "Prestegarden" (which it's still called toda
2 CONC y) in Eidfjord, Hordaland
2 CONT
