1 NAME Lauritz Davidsen /Maxwell/
2 GIVN Lauritz Davidsen
2 SURN Maxwell
2 _MARNM Hjortland
2 NICK Lars (Lawrence) Davidsen Hjortland
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1590
2 PLAC Killin
