1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from: Odda, Ullensvang og Kinsarvik i gamal og ny tid, (by Olav Kolltveit) volume 3/2 Odda (p. 115) - Bruk 1 Vasstun.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore was brother of Lars Salamonson Y. Jaastad br. 1 (In Y. Jastad Lars Salamonson is called Kraakevik -- But Salomon in Kraakevik is Not listed with sons Tore & Lars, just Johannes...) Both Tore & Lars were probably of the Hovlan
2 CONC d family since they owned a part in Hovland that they sold to Ivar Hovland in 1670. Tore also bought what the Hovland people owned in Vasstun.
