2 CONT Skifte på Ile oktober 1730; https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/15920/358?indexing=
2 CONT
2 CONT Ile became the gong divided between the brother Gudmund Larson Ile (Ihle) Årvik and Byfogd Peder Ile (Ihle) Larsson Tønder (Kragerø). Margreta Larsdatter Østereide Norheim got Opsal. (Grand uncle Olaf Johannesson Nising was marrie
2 CONC d Lisbeth Sakariasdotter Norheim, Etne. Possibly the connection to Norheim, Etne) The grandson of Lars, Anne Marie Gudmundsdotter Årvik Ile and her man Zacharias Johannesson took over Ile in 1750 and moved there. (Arvid Staupe)
