2 CONT '''Berete Valentindtr. TALGJE'''
2 CONT * '''Born:''' 1675, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway [1]
2 CONT * '''Marriage:''' Ola Asgautson SKJELSNES in 1694
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 1713 at age 38
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Spouses/Children:''' 
2 CONT ** Ola Asgautson SKJELSNES 
2 CONT *** Asgaut Olson REILSTAD+
2 CONT
2 CONT * Berete '''married''' Ola Asgautson SKJELSNES  in 1694.
2 CONT ** '''son of''' Asgaut Larsson JØRSTAD and Åsa Trulsdtr. SKJELSNES, 
2 CONT ** (Ola Asgautson SKJELSNES was born on 15 Apr 1657 in Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway[2] and died on 11 Oct 1732 in Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway.)
2 CONT
