1 NOTE {geni:about_me} from: Odda, Ullensvang og Kinsarvik i gamal og ny tid - vol. 3/2 Odda (p. 115)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elling was born Vasstun, Odda; he used farm together with his brother Jens until Jens died 1695, then farmed the entire property.  (Jens skifte 28 February 1695). Elling was church ombudsman 1705-08.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1718 Elling & Oddmund Sandvin were taken to court by Gunnar Sandvin for fighting.  It was one of those fights by drunks that was settled in court.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1682 he married Anna Oddmundsdatter & they had 4 children; Anna died 1696; he married his #2 in 1699: Guro Olsdatter Kambestad U. br. 1 (1664-1749) & they had one daughter Anna. b. 1705.
