1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lars Olsen Tvedt (f~1648), son of Ole Ingemarsen og Ingeborg Larsd. Valhammer.  He is noted as "Lars Olsen Tvedt af Saters Skibred og Norhors" in 1712 sk. after Ingeborg and her 2nd husband Jon.  Most of the rest b
2 CONC elow is discussion/speculation/leads that may or may not refer to the same Lars.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 04jun1677 viede paa Domkirken (Askoy): https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/8632/60
2 CONT ** Lars Olsen og Karen Pedersdatter "Thuet"(?)
2 CONT ** Same Lars?
2 CONT
2 CONT * Askoy historie book: https://www.nb.no/items/d8aa7c58a15561acde411fa99459d5fb?page=271&searchText=Tveit
2 CONT ** s.246, table 2: Lagrettemenn fra Askoy (1642-1733)
2 CONT ** 1699 Lars Tveit
2 CONT ** Since only one "Lars" at Tvedt in Askoy in 1701 Manntallet, this is probably the same Lars.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1701 Manntallet for Askøy, g. "Tuedt", s.100 : https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/38454/60
2 CONT ** Lars Olsen (53) --- tjeneste drenge: Jonas(?) (18 -> f~1683 Lindaas)
2 CONT ** Mads Jons. (30) --- son: Mons Madsen (3)
2 CONT ** Lars Christophers. (26)
2 CONT ** NOTE: Lars Olsen could have been married but no sons mentioned.  Likely he had no sons or they left.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1704 Sjomanntalet??? https://www.digitalarkivet.no/view/215/pp00000000041390
2 CONT ** Lars Olssen Fondnes (60aar -> f~1644), Østremb, Lindaas
2 CONT
2 CONT * Magnille (Magnhild) bor i Kjøkkelvik eller Skålevik ved Bergen gm Hans Pedersen Skålevik se skifte 1705. Ved skifte i 1705 så er ”Lauritz Tuedt” laugverge for Magnhild
2 CONT ** skannet: https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/24069/130
2 CONT ** discussion: https://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/178250-hvem-er-foreldra-til-ingeborg-larsdtr-valhammer-skifte-1712/?tab=comments#comment-1532886
2 CONT
2 CONT * 25nov1712 skifte etter mor og stedfar Jon Storksen:
2 CONT ** "Hvem er foreldra til Ingeborg Larsdtr Valhammer skifte 1712?" https://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/178250-hvem-er-foreldra-til-ingeborg-larsdtr-valhammer-skifte-1712/?tab=comments#comment-1532886
2 CONT ** 1712 skifte skannet: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081112640005
2 CONT *** Ingeborgs son Ingemon had died, but Lars was living '''Lars Olsen Tvedt af Saters Skibrede og Nordhors'''. That means it is not in Askøy, as that was Herdla skibrede. “Sater” is the same as the island Sartor, parishes Sund and
2 CONC  Fjell. There were several farms called Tveit (Nore Tveit, Midttbveit, Søre Tveit) and Tveite there. 
2 CONT  Have searched in the bygdebok, but no Lars Olsen."
2 CONT
2 CONT * 7 Avdod for Lars Olsen i Domskirken, Askoy fra 1701-1760: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/search/persons/advanced?from=&to=&m%5B%5D=1247&firstname=Lars&lastname=Olsen&roles%5B%5D=avd%C3%B8d&birth_year_from=&birth_year_to=&birth_da
2 CONC te=&birth_place=&domicile=&position=&event_year_from=1701&event_year_to=1760&event_date=&related_first_name=&related_last_name=&related_birth_year=
2 CONT
2 CONT 		Looks like the Austrheim bygdebok with gards info is not accessible online…
2 CONT
2 CONT 		Another: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/view/327/pv00000001191878
2 CONT 			Lars Olsen Houstveed g.18Jan1685m. Inger Olsdtr i. Hamre, Hordaland
2 CONT
2 CONT 		Many other Lars Olsens in records getting married, but not with a "Tveit" home.
2 CONT
2 CONT 		Another: Tveito (nedre gnr25, ovre gnr27, s.4), or also "Tveiten"(gnr.46, s.735), Lindaas Prg, Myking Sogn in NordHordaland:
2 CONT 		Tveiten: No indication in Lindaas bygdebok "Tveiten" farms that this Lars Olsen was there:
2 CONT 		OvreTveit (g#27, s.434+): Bygdebok for Lindås. 1 : Myking sokn : gards- og ættesoge (nb.no) : Same.
2 CONT 		NedreTveit (g#25, s.404+): https://www.nb.no/items/233541c42eba93608edf460777b10cbb?page=407
2 CONT 			Bruk#4, Bruker#3 has this:
2 CONT 			• b.1711-1720 Lars og kone --- they don't know where either was from.  No last name…
2 CONT 				□ 4 Barn: Jon (f.1713), Erik (f.1713), Kari (f.1715), Haldor (f.1717)
2 CONT 			• 1731 skifte: Haldor Lars.* - Skiftedesignasjoner 1731 for Nordhordland sorenskriveri - Digitalarkivet (Lars, wife Ane, sons Jon, Erik, Haldor & Niels, datter: Anne) --- same?
2 CONT 			• 1737 Ane Jansdatter skifte: Haldor Larsøn - Skiftedesignasjoner 1735-1748 for Nordhordland sorenskriveri - Digitalarkivet --- same Ane?
