1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.choicemn.com/trees/larson-eiken/3551.html Tormod Torjuson (Torgilson) ROPEID
2 CONT * '''Born:''' 1729, Ropeid, Sand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT * '''Marriage''': Ingeri Johansdatter TJELMELAND on 25 Jun 1758 in Sand, Rogaland, Norway[1] 
2 CONT * '''Died:''' 17 Nov 1811, Sand, Rogaland, Norway at age 82 2
2 CONT * '''Other names''' for Tormod were Tormod Torgiusen ROBEJD and Tormund Torgiussen ROBEJD.
2 CONT * '''Death Notes''':  87aar
2 CONT * '''Spouses/Children:''' 
2 CONT ** Ingeri Johansdatter TJELMELAND 
2 CONT *** Borghild Tormodsdatter ROPEID+ '''Noted events in his life were:'''
2 CONT *''' Alt. Birth:''' based on age at death, Abt 1724, <Norway>.
2 CONT * '''Census:''' farm Robejd, 1801, Jelsa, Rogaland, Norway. County district Parish Local parish Gard/hus 89 Stavanger Jelsøe Sand Robejd 
2 CONT ** New household Given name; Last name; Household pos.; Age; Marital status; Occupation; Sex: 
2 CONT *** 1565 * Torgius Tormodsen Husbonde 34 Begge i 1ste ægteskab Gaardmand og medhielper M 
2 CONT *** 1566 Birtha Torgiersdtr Hans kone 21 Begge i 1ste ægteskab K 
2 CONT *** 1567 Ingeri Torgiusdtr 1 K 
