2 CONT * Tormod '''married Ingeri Johansdatter TJELMELAND''', on 25 Jun 1758 in Sand, Rogaland, Norway.[1]  
2 CONT ** daughter of Johannes Åmundson (Omundson) TJELMELAND and Guri (Gudrid) Reinardsdtr. HELGEVOLL,
2 CONT ** (Ingeri Johansdatter TJELMELAND '''was born''' in 1738 in Sand, Rogaland, Norway and '''died on''' 22 Nov 1804 in Sand, Rogaland, Norway[3] .)   Noted events in their marriage were:
2 CONT * '''Engagement''', 27 Mar 1758, Sand, Rogaland, Norway.
2 CONT * Marriage Notes:  Dom. V Post Trinitatis 
